- action(n1, "start"): Hallucinates an initial step not described in the source, which begins directly with "At first, the doctor receives a request." (SMC1)
- action(n8, "end process"): Hallucinates a terminal step not described in the source, which concludes immediately after sending the medicine with "Finally, the process ends." (SMC1)
- actor(a_default, "Default", [...] ): Incorrectly assigns all process nodes to a "Default" participant instead of the "doctor" explicitly named as responsible for every step in the source text. (SMC7)